:: Act3_7Eleven_Combat {"position":"750,1950","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentLocation to "seven_eleven_interior">>
<<set _arrivedLate to (visited("Act2_5_MarcusCabin"))>>

/* Initialize combat enemies */
<<if ndef $s711_enemies>>
    <<set $s711_enemies to [
        { name: "Scavenger Enforcer", hp: 35, maxHp: 35, dmg: 12, ev: 10 },
        { name: "Frenzied Runner", hp: 25, maxHp: 25, dmg: 10, ev: 20 },
        { name: "Scavenger Shooter", hp: 30, maxHp: 30, dmg: 15, ev: 15 }
    ]>>
<</if>>
<</nobr>>

<h2>7-ELEVEN — MAIN CONVENIENCE STORE FLOOR</h2>

<<if $s711_enemies.length > 0>>
    You and Reyes kick through the shattered double glass doors, firing into the smoke!
    <br><br>
    Toppled snack shelves, spilled soda cans, and bloodstained linoleum fill the store. Two armed scavengers and a snarling infected turn toward you with raised weapons!
    <br><br>
    Behind the thick glass of the walk-in beverage cooler at the back, Commander Miller and his surviving guard bleed on the floor, holding the steel door shut!
    <br><br>
    <<chat "Commander Miller (Cooler)" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "Reyes! Flank the shooters! Don't let them hit the fuel canisters!">>

    <br><br>
    <div style="background: rgba(80,0,0,0.2); border: 1px solid #8a1c1c; padding: 15px; text-align:center;">
        <h3 style="color:var(--accent-red); margin-top:0;">HOSTILES REMAINING: <<print $s711_enemies.length>></h3>
        <div style="border:1px solid #333; background:#000; padding:10px; max-width:320px; margin:0 auto; text-align:left;">
            <<for _i, _e range $s711_enemies>>
                <div style="border-bottom:1px dashed #333; padding:5px; font-family: monospace;">
                    TARGET: <span style="color:var(--accent-red)">_e.name</span> (HP: _e.hp/_e.maxHp)
                </div>
            <</for>>
        </div>
    </div>

    <br><br>
    <div class="choice-menu">
        <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-red) !important;">
            <<link "💥 Open Fire on the Scavengers">>
                <<addTime 1>>
                /* Deal damage to first enemy */
                <<set $s711_enemies[0].hp -= 20>>
                <<if $s711_enemies[0].hp <= 0>>
                    <<run $s711_enemies.shift()>>
                <</if>>
                <<goto "Act3_7Eleven_Combat">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub">Engage the hostiles pinning down Commander Miller.</span>
        </button>
    </div>

<<else>>
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div style="font-size:3em;">💀</div>
        <h2 style="color:var(--accent-green)">ALL HOSTILES ELIMINATED</h2>
        <br>
        <span style="color:var(--accent-gold); font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold;">[+50 XP] [+25 TRUST]</span>
        <<run window.gainXP(50)>>
        <<run window.gainTrust(25)>>
    </div>

    The gunshots die down, replaced by the hiss of leaking refrigerator freon and dying groans.
    <br><br>
    The heavy steel walk-in cooler door creaks open. Commander Miller steps out, a bloodied bandage wrapped tight around his shoulder, holding a shotgun in one hand and a heavy jerrycan of diesel fuel in the other.

    <br><br>
    <<chat "Commander Miller" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "Good shooting, kid. If you and Reyes hadn't breached when you did, we'd be dog meat in that cooler.">>

    <br><br>
    <<if _arrivedLate>>
        <<chat "Commander Miller" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "I heard you got into Timberline late after sunrise. You've already proven your worth twice over.">>
    <<else>>
        <<chat "Commander Miller" "image/avatars/quartermaster_sgtvance.gif" "right" "I heard you arrived early before the rain started. Fast on your feet and steady under fire. Exactly what Timberline needs.">>
    <</if>>

    <br><br>
    /* COMPLETE RESCUE OBJECTIVE */
    <<completeObjective "rescue_leader_711">>
    <<purgeCompleted>>

    <br><br>
    <div class="choice-menu">
        <button style="border-left-color: var(--accent-green) !important;">
            <<link "🚗 Escort Commander Miller back to Timberline Sanctuary" "Act3_7Eleven_RescueSuccess">>
                <<addTime 15>>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-green);">[MISSION COMPLETE]</b> Return triumphantly to the high school sanctuary.</span>
        </button>
    </div>
<</if>>
